target: internal/migrate/handoff.go
failure-mode: |
  The handoff commits migration/state=done without first recording the
  local guard as pending. A crash between the commit and the done guard
  restarts the source with no guard, so local ingest starts before the
  migrator reads the catalog and finds the archive is no longer its own.
expected-detection: |
  TestMigration_CrashSeams/after-migration-done kills the source right
  after the commit and requires the guard to read pending.
expected-tier: migration
tiers: migration

